{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create and sell your unique succulent bonsai.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can grow a complete succulent using succulent leaves. When the succulent is in the state of flower sword, it is possible to generate a new variety of succulents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/a5aec78fd1845c255e3de1503d455196.poster.avif?t=1751010329\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/a5aec78fd1845c255e3de1503d455196.webm?t=1751010329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/a5aec78fd1845c255e3de1503d455196.mp4?t=1751010329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use flower pots, succulents and ornaments to create your personalized bonsai. There are a wealth of materials to match here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/19474a5a5e6b34622a7fc52f4a9f3722.poster.avif?t=1751010329\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/19474a5a5e6b34622a7fc52f4a9f3722.webm?t=1751010329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/19474a5a5e6b34622a7fc52f4a9f3722.mp4?t=1751010329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to every customer's story and pack and send them the most suitable succulent bonsai.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/544c6c14f01bf982502a6319c0b800c1.poster.avif?t=1751010329\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/544c6c14f01bf982502a6319c0b800c1.webm?t=1751010329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/544c6c14f01bf982502a6319c0b800c1.mp4?t=1751010329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also keep the beautiful succulent bonsai and put it on the display stand for your own appreciation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/dad11bd1ab36ffb41dcef9e9af132000.poster.avif?t=1751010329\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/dad11bd1ab36ffb41dcef9e9af132000.webm?t=1751010329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/dad11bd1ab36ffb41dcef9e9af132000.mp4?t=1751010329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has no big goals and no winning or losing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The probability of items appearing is relatively high, so there will not be too much pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just calm down and feel the joy of creation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like simple planting and creation, give it a try (Add to your wishlist !)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1664520?t=1751010329","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/bc1c79f0fd4bf50ed15e558e6ebadc4c399d4ebc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751010329","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/f69595ed2c4e6cbe66f65d2ab988839d6e221fa9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751010329","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/f69595ed2c4e6cbe66f65d2ab988839d6e221fa9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751010329","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create and sell your unique succulent bonsai.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can grow a complete succulent using succulent leaves. When the succulent is in the state of flower sword, it is possible to generate a new variety of succulents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/a5aec78fd1845c255e3de1503d455196.poster.avif?t=1751010329\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/a5aec78fd1845c255e3de1503d455196.webm?t=1751010329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"