ent bonsai and put it on the display stand for your own appreciation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/dad11bd1ab36ffb41dcef9e9af132000.poster.avif?t=1751010329\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/dad11bd1ab36ffb41dcef9e9af132000.webm?t=1751010329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/dad11bd1ab36ffb41dcef9e9af132000.mp4?t=1751010329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has no big goals and no winning or losing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The probability of items appearing is relatively high, so there will not be too much pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just calm down and feel the joy of creation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like simple planting and creation, give it a try (Add to your wishlist !)</p>","developers":["Ergou Li"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/1454e488a48ecaa33609edebaf35a8e878379c17/header.jpg?t=1751010329","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Ergou Li Game. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1664520/1987115834/c722e6eaee409d3aed685e9517a94b1a1354696d/1751016678/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748170081","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/16645